jan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXplcmJhaWphbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Azerbaijan</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Armenia.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Armenia.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e7/Flag_of_Armenia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20180204204349\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Armenia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJtZW5pYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Armenia</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Slovenia.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Slovenia.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/d2/Flag_of_Slovenia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20180204195111\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Slovenia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2xvdmVuaWE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Slovenia</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Croatia.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Croatia.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/18/Flag_of_Croatia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20180226200658\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Croatia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ3JvYXRpYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Croatia</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Vojvodina (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX1ZvanZvZGluYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Template:Country data Vojvodina</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Srpska (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX1NycHNrYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Template:Country data Srpska</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Circassian (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX0NpcmNhc3NpYW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Template:Country data Circassian</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Tartar Republic (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX1RhcnRhcl9SZXB1YmxpYz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Template:Country data Tartar Republic</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Bashkiria (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX0Jhc2hraXJpYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Template:Country data Bashkiria</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Brandenburg (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX0JyYW5kZW5idXJnP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Template:Country data Brandenburg</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Saxony (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX1NheG9ueT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Template:Country data Saxony</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Country data Bavaria (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Q291bnRyeV9kYXRhX0JhdmFyaWE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Template:Country data Bavaria</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Austria.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Austria.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/83/Flag_of_Austria.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20150817154039\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Austria (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXVzdHJpYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Austria</span></li></ul>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><i>Not specified</i>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Political structure</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collective_security#Collective_defense\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Collective security\">Military alliance</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Historical era</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mexican-American_Cold_War\" title=\"Mexican-American Cold War\">Mexican-American Cold War</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2102\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Disestablished\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2139\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Intermarium</b> was a military and economic alliance of several Eastern European States. Born out of a desire for regional stability following the collapse of the Mediterranean Union, the Intermarium was formally established under the Second Treaty of Visegrad on 1 November 2102 upon the foundations of the pre-existing Visegrad Group.\n</p><p>The Intermarium traces its origins back to World War I when Polish leader Józef Piłsudski proposed the creation of a federation, under Poland's aegis, uniting Eastern Europe in common defense against Germany and Russia. Since then the union has grown in size through the accession of \nnew countries, and new policy areas have been added to the remit of the Intermarium's institutions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Politics\">Politics</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIntermarium%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Intermarium Council in Visegrad is dominated by the Poles, by far the strongest military and economic power of the bloc.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119061952\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: fals